WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:05.020
Trample down the Golden Knight
and take the girl our King desires!

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:06.440
Zaruba!

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:15.140
You are definitely worthy
of being my ultimate nemesis!

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.410
Mouths that dare dirty his name?

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.580
Eyes that dare to glare with malice?

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.430
I cannot stand such things.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:30.130
I will not allow anyone 
to lay a finger on him.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:34.580
Someone like you would never
understand the true worth of El Dorado.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:47.230
The time has come.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.480
Our great desire,

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:52.940
the true El Dorado,
will soon be set into motion.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:56.530
You know your role, do you not?

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.700
Knight is <i>absent</i> today.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:02.410
To escape him twice...

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:05.460
The princess and
her crew are quite troublesome.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:10.880
The orders of our master are absolute.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:14.210
We must obtain the girl as soon as possible.

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.800
Everything is for the sake of King.

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:29.280
Just as we planned.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:31.730
I understand.

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:33.620
Bring her here alive.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:39.050
Obsessing over one little girl.
What is King thinking?

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:46.700
Well, it's an order,
so I guess it can't be helped.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.480
Is that the data you got from Alan?

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:37.240
Yeah. There's all sorts of info
on the GarEden Corporation.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:41.450
It looks like it was originally
a small software company.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:45.410
Ten years ago, it branched out
within the electronics industry

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:48.160
and made a whole slew of innovative products,

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:51.000
making the company
expand at an exponential rate.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:52.460
Ten years ago?

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:57.710
They merged with another company
and obtained a lot of talented people.

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:02.970
Um, the name of the
company was... Cygnusra...

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.510
Cygnusram-Tech?

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.200
Right! That!

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:14.230
So, it is clear that Horrors were involved

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.690
in the explosion at Cygnusram-Tech.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.400
S-Sword?

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:24.360
Huh? Oh, it's nothing!

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:41.050
So many people. Are all of them...?

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:44.010
No, more than half are regular humans.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:48.350
They're probably working
for Horrors without knowing anything.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:52.630
If we go there, we'll know
more about the true El Dorado.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:56.310
There, I'll find my big brother...

00:04:56.690 --> 00:05:00.190
We're going to wait
until nightfall and break right in.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.850
Are you still eating like that?

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.270
Why not?

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.350
Eat and move.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.580
You can't get much done
if you worry about every little thing.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:23.800
Excuse me!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:26.340
I'd like to add a deluxe pizza
and golden parfait to the order!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:28.840
Also, this splash orange juice.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.800
Um. Can I also get two cheeseburgers

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.350
and a side of mashed potatoes to go?

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.060
Ah, yes.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.560
Oh! And! And! Fried rice,
gyoza, and dandan noodles!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.190
Oh, of course you wouldn't have those!

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:48.570
Please be safe, Brother.

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.530
He must've been a really good brother.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:55.790
Yeah. He always cared for me.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:06:00.160
No matter what.
He was so serious and so gentle.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.420
Probably the complete opposite of you, Sword.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:07.760
Sorry for being thoughtless
and rough around the edges!

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:11.410
But I made it this far because of you, Sword.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:17.270
If I were alone, I'd probably still
be running around helplessly in the city.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:19.200
It's all thanks to you, Sword.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:23.820
I am the strongest Makai Knight, after all.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:27.950
Thank you for traveling with me.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:29.610
Hey.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.660
It's gotten troublesome.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:34.120
Come over quickly.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.330
What are these things?

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.670
Plants from Makai.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.530
Make sure to stay close to us.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:47.240
Let's hurry.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.600
Here, too?

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.730
What about all the workers?

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.180
What the hell is going on?

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.100
It happened so suddenly.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:38.410
Those weird plants appeared
and suddenly attacked us.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.640
Everyone... Everyone!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.580
So the humans lost their use?

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:49.230
They moved so openly!
They don't even plan on hiding anymore?!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.450
I'm guessing they no longer have the need to.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:55.740
In other words, we should assume
the true El Dorado is complete.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.780
Um, are there any other survivors?

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:04.120
I don't know. I saw them
running away in that direction.

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:19.960
There's no one here.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:42.450
You lost your chance of escape
the moment you stepped foot in here.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.920
Hand over that girl.

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.590
That's a request I just can't comply with.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.340
You bitch!

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.340
Ones who protect, huh?

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:41.720
What will you do when you
are betrayed by those very people?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:42.890
What?

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.770
You shouldn't let your guard down.

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.480
Wh-What?

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:53.780
You!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.490
Sword!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.960
Sophie!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:07.250
See you.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.040
That was the power of a Makai Alchemist.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.410
We won't find him even
if we follow the presence of Horrors.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:36.490
Losing our cool is exactly
what they want us to do.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.290
Sorry.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.820
I already have something in place.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:48.710
You coward!

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:51.210
They always only watch out for Horrors.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:57.090
Makai Knights truly never learn or advance.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.320
Welcome.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:12.510
To our holy land.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.540
What is this place?

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:36.800
This is a place birthed 
by the true El Dorado.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:38.260
Please look.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.010
It is the crystallization of wisdom itself.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:46.220
One cannot help but be
enthralled by the beauty of this place.

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:51.440
And yet, no one tried
to understand this happiness.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:53.690
Those obsolete fools.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:57.190
I experimented on a mere 10 or 20 humans

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.230
and they cast me aside as a deviant.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:02.660
In the end, they even tried
to take away my research!

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:06.950
However, Master Bishop was different!

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.580
That man praised my work!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.160
He told me that he needed me!

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:18.880
Now, King is waiting
for you in the true El Dorado.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:19.380
Hm?

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.180
Why?!

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:32.890
As expected of the girl desired by King.

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:35.310
Stimulation is life!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:40.940
You may stimulate a new revelation
in my beloved brain cells!

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:45.780
It is pointless to run.

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.510
I have to get out of here fast!

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:02.830
This...

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:30.330
There's no mistake.
My brother was definitely here!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:43.260
"...GarEden's facility was far more
sophisticated than I ever expected.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:46.480
I'm certain my research
will become a reality here.

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:51.470
A dream apparatus that can liberate
people from various sufferings.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:56.480
Once the apparatus is completed,
I know I can make Sophie happy again.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:02.940
Ever since Mom and Dad passed,
she has been put through so much pain.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:06.730
And that's why I want
to put a smile on Sophie's face.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.410
That's my wish.

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.100
Hang on a little longer.

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:17.510
I promise you I will create
a future for you, Sophie."

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.220
This whole time.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:30.000
He thought of me this whole time...

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:43.480
Huh?

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.800
"Thank you for your letter, Brother.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:51.150
Your research is important,
but you have to eat properly, too."

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:57.120
I... didn't write these letters!

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:58.620
Found you.

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:09.970
Tell me!

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.040
Where did you hide my brother?!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.610
They are people from this city.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:28.570
No, I should say they
<i>were</i> people from this city.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:31.530
All of these people?

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:34.330
They are so lucky.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:37.790
They were able to contribute
directly to such a grand invention.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.280
Is my brother in there, too?!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.210
Are you scared?

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:46.670
Why? Why did you do something like this?

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.170
King wished it so.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:53.530
Making his wishes a reality. That is my wish.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:59.250
So, I hate someone who
causes him trouble, like you.

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:03.100
King wants me, right?

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.610
Do not worry.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:08.860
In the holy land, mere physical
injuries will be of no matter.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:13.360
People who go to the
true El Dorado can never return.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:14.820
The same will go for you.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.210
Looks like we made it in time.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:25.910
Sword! Luke!

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:33.050
We knew your location,
but we didn't know how to get to you.

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:35.430
So we smashed ourselves a little shortcut.

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.680
Hang on just a little longer.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.390
We'll wrap things up quickly.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:52.990
Mistress Queen, I leave the rest to you.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:53.900
Wait!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.160
Leave things to me here and go after Sophie!

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:08.710
Go!

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.390
Out of the way!

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.510
I'm your opponent.

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.570
You bastard!

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:55.330
Sophie.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.390
Sword.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:01.890
Goodness.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:05.770
What an embarrassing scene, Stanley.

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:12.070
I-I am very sorry, Master Bishop!
Please! Please have mercy!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.230
No, no. No matter.

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:17.400
I'll have you put to good use.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.540
He's going to blow in a few seconds.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.590
At this rate, the princess
will be caught in the blast.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:38.510
Won't that spell trouble
for both of us, Golden Knight?

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.560
So, what will you do?

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.890
We'll finish things later.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:33.890
Sword! Sword?!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:40.840
Weren't those some nice fireworks?

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:04.510
Go enjoy yourself.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.420
Sophie!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:14.010
I was waiting for you,

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:19.260
Sophie.
